# The functions of Mission_TransportKiller in level outskirts (the script levels/outskirts/scripts/mission_transportkiller.py of data01.packed) that are data: one section
# per function, its parameters after the name. The other functions of the script stay Python: InitStatus, Init, InitTransport, isValidDamage, TryToDeath, TakeDataPack, TryToDamage, InitCall, SetNextMission.
# Made by a converter from the script. A pack in mods/ with scrapc/levels/outskirts/mission_transportkiller.def replaces this file.
section UsePhoneCab UsrName CharName optId FullOption
setvar Speech.PlayerName $UsrName
setvar Speech.NPCName $CharName
call PhoneCab.UseAudioCom $UsrName $CharName $optId $FullOption
setvar Speech.OnEndOfSpeech %Mission_TransportKiller.SetNextMission
setvar Speech.OnEndOfSpeechParams ()
call Speech.NISpeech "PoliceBoss"
call Speech.AutoAddNI "Mission_Get4thClue_ComPoliceBoss_NI_1Msg"
call Speech.RunNI
